ind":"update","title":"Japanese Swordsmith Demo UPDATE 0.2.6","summary":"Thank you for all your feedback on the demo!We've released a new update (v0.2.6) for the Japanese Swordsmith Demo. Here are the changes included in this update.Disposal BoxA disposal box has been added to the forge.You can discard empty material boxes and tekobo you no longer need.Discarded items cannot be taken back.Improvements & ChangesThe object rename screen now shows control hints.The Tab menu now shows a control hint at the bottom.The temperature bar for steel in the forge hearth is now e","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T12:47:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041860","verified_at":"2026-10-25T16:25:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958850-1846651706692207","game_id":"steam-4958850","kind":"update","title":"Japanese Swordsmith Demo UPDATE 0.2.5","summary":"Thank you for all your feedback on the demo!We've released a new update (v0.2.5) for the Japanese Swordsmith Demo. Here are the main changes and fixes included in this update.Polishing UpdateSimply moving the blade no longer causes it to be polished.Hold Shift and use the mouse to press the blade against the whetstone and polish it.Made the valid polishing direction easier to understand.Polishing score gains and penalties now appear in real time as pop-up bubbles.Refined the polishing mode UI fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:40:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692207","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958850-1846018067939663","game_id":"steam-4958850","kind":"update","title":"Japanese Swordsmith Demo UPDATE 0.2.4","summary":"Thank you for all your feedback on the demo!We've released a new update (v0.2.4) for the Japanese Swordsmith Demo. Here are the main changes and fixes included in this update.Improvements & ChangesReduced steel mass loss from hammer strikes during Wakashinobe (rough drawing-out). This makes it easier to reach the required blade length during the subsequent Sunobe stage. Please note that steel mass already lost in existing workpieces will not be restored automatically.Bug FixesFixed an issue wher","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T00:38:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939663","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958850-1846018067937419","game_id":"steam-4958850","kind":"update","title":"Japanese Swordsmith Demo UPDATE 0.2.3","summary":"Thank you for all your feedback on the demo!We've released a new update (v0.2.3) for the Japanese Swordsmith Demo. Here is the fix included in this update.Bug FixesFixed an issue in Clay Application that could cause increased system load.Thank you for playing Japanese Swordsmith! Your feedback and support mean a lot to us and help us continue improving the game.We'll keep working to make the experience even better. If you encounter any issues or have suggestions, please feel free to share your f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T22:28:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937419","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958850-1846018067934663","game_id":"steam-4958850","kind":"update","title":"Japanese Swordsmith Demo UPDATE 0.2.2","summary":"Thank you for all your feedback on the demo!We've released a new update (v0.2.2) for the Japanese Swordsmith Demo.Here are the main changes and fixes included in this update.Improvements & ChangesAdjusted the required blade dimensions for each quest to make objectives easier to achieve.Improved the Sunobe mode UI to make blade length adjustment easier to understand.Items can no longer be purchased from the Purchasing Ledger if you already have 10 of the same item in your workshop.Steel temperatu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T21:09:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934663","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958850-1846018067930352","game_id":"steam-4958850","kind":"announcement","title":"Free Demo Now Available – Reveal a Hamon from Your Clay Pattern","summary":"The free demo of Japanese Swordsmith is now available on Steam!Japanese Swordsmith is a hardcore first-person Japanese swordsmith simulation where you forge a Japanese sword by hand.The free demo lets you experience a selection of the game's swordmaking processes, including charcoal cutting, Wakashinobe, Sunobe, Hizukuri, clay application, quenching, and polishing.One of the key experiences in the demo is the sequence:Clay Application → Quenching → Polishing → HamonApply the clay pattern yoursel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T16:06:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930352","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958850-1845383656397018","game_id":"steam-4958850","kind":"update","title":"Japanese Swordsmith Demo UPDATE 0.2.0","summary":"Following the closed playtest, we have released a further update to Japanese Swordsmith.Thank you so much to everyone who took part!AddedAppreciation modeHold the blade and open it from the sword stand in the forge.You can freely set the camera angle, change the background and the text, and take a photo.You can also check the sword’s measurements in cm and shaku.Clay coating, quenching, and polishingThe previous build (0.1.0) went as far as wakashinobe, sunobe, and hizukuri. This update adds cla","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T16:30:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397018","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958850-1844115010501066","game_id":"steam-4958850","kind":"update","title":"Japanese Swordsmith — Closed playtest update (A message from the developer)","summary":"We've published a video about the closed playtest.It covers what's underway, what you can play in this version, what we'd like you to watch for, and how to apply.Please take a look!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T11:04:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010501066","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958850-1843481262688246","game_id":"steam-4958850","kind":"announcement","title":"Japanese Swordsmith — What this game is about (A message from the developer)","summary":"We've published a developer video covering the game overview, game design, and roadmap.It also talks about what we care about in this game — please take a look!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T07:18:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262688246","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958850-1842846814448925","game_id":"steam-4958850","kind":"announcement","title":"Closed playtest — Japanese Swordsmith (small)","summary":"We're running a small closed playtest.What's in this versionCut charcoal. Light the fire. Work the bellows. Heat and hammer the steel the master prepared. Shape one short blade. Hang it on the rack, and you're clear.This is an early build, so there may be many bugs.If you get stuck, the controls confuse you, or it crashes, please tell us.Your feedback will go into the next Demo.Details• Selection: not first come.• Requirements: a Steam account and a Windows PC.• Keys: we will email a Steam Demo ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T12:00:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814448925","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958850-1840944183775977","game_id":"steam-4958850","kind":"announcement","title":"Japanese Swordsmith Steam page is now live","summary":"From tamahagane to a finished katana.Japanese Swordsmith is now Coming Soon on Steam.Become a swordsmith in Bakumatsu Kyoto—sumikiri, mizuheshi, folding forge, the quench, polishing—and finish a Japanese sword with your own hands. A hardcore swordsmith simulator. It will not be easy.Wishlist so you don’t miss Early Access and the Steam Next Fest demo later: Community: https://discord.gg/feESU6cSk7The path of the swordsmith is long and steep.Can you forge a blade worthy of history?","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T07:09:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183775977","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4958850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:51:39Z","status":"ok",